WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.976 --> 00:00:08.225
<b>Part 3</b>

2
00:00:12.387 --> 00:00:16.133
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> Walid walks for five days through the mountains.

3
00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:20.745
The sun shines, and at night it’s very cold.

4
00:00:21.278 --> 00:00:24.824
Then, one evening, he finds the palace.

5
00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:30.468
The prince welcomes him and gives him food and drink, and a comfortable bed.

6
00:00:30.918 --> 00:00:36.528
But Walid can’t sleep. He’s thinking about the one thousand gold coins.

7
00:00:37.344 --> 00:00:39.958
The next morning, he says to the prince,

8
00:00:40.275 --> 00:00:47.450
‘I want to say thank you to you. Please have this silver ring. It’s my mother’s.’

9
00:00:48.016 --> 00:00:53.760
The prince is very happy. ‘This is a beautiful ring,’ he says.

10
00:00:53.844 --> 00:00:58.256
‘Thank you. Let me give you something in return.’

11
00:00:58.905 --> 00:01:00.770
He gives Walid a box.

12
00:01:01.103 --> 00:01:04.749
‘Don’t open this until you get home,’ he says.

13
00:01:04.982 --> 00:01:10.560
‘Be careful with it. It’s very, very valuable.’

14
00:01:11.492 --> 00:01:17.319
Walid runs through the mountains, and after three days he arrives home.

15
00:01:17.902 --> 00:01:21.698
‘Where’s my silver ring?’ shouts his mother.

16
00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:25.411
‘Don’t worry about your ring!’ says Walid.

17
00:01:25.461 --> 00:01:27.991
‘Look at this!’

18
00:01:28.391 --> 00:01:32.453
Hassan and their mother watch as he opens the box.

19
00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:38.697
Inside he finds the glass bottle.